  "Id": 1655,
  "Title": "Prestigious award for Dr Gilani",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Professor Anwar Gilani has been honoured with the Pride of Performance Award.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassB5CAF23311D3405483A5C285F9F85708\"><p>Professor Anwar Gilani has been honoured with the Pride of Performance Award by the president of Pakistan.&#160;</p><p>Dr Gilani joined AKU in 1986 as a senior instructor and rose to become a professor of pharmacology in 1997. He has a wide range of research interests and has made breakthrough discoveries in the area of natural products pharmacology.&#160;</p><p>While commenting on the motivations for his research, Dr Gilani said&#58; &quot;There is a need to explore our indigenous resources and to develop a system where traditional and modern physicians can work together for better healthcare of non-affording patients, who comprise the majority of our country's population.&quot;<br></p></div>",
